    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="KR3j0192-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-1a.1-h" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:03.597+09:00">Huán Tán</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-1a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:03.597+09:00">, "Huán Zǐ Xīn Lùn"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-3a.4-h" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:03.597+09:00">, "Běn Zào Dì Yī"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-3a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:03.597+09:00">: Qín Lǚ Bùwéi invited and welcomed those with profound knowledge,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-3a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:03.597+09:00">and composed "Lǚ Shì Chūnqiū."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-3a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:03.597+09:00">The King of Huáinán in the Hàn dynasty employed eloquent and knowledgeable individuals from across the land</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-3a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:03.597+09:00">to write chapters.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-3a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:03.597+09:00">Once the books were completed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-3a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:03.597+09:00">they were all displayed in the city markets,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-3a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:03.597+09:00">with a thousand gold pieces offered</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-3a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:03.597+09:00">to invite scholars to examine them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-3a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:03.597+09:00">but no one could alter or improve them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-3a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:03.597+09:00">This was because the content was concise and elegant,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-3a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:03.597+09:00">the structure complete, and the arguments subtle.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-3a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:03.597+09:00">See the commentary in "Wén Xuǎn‧Yáng Dézǔ."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-4a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:03.597+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-4a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:03.597+09:00">Dǒng Zhòngshū was dedicated to narrating the past.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-4a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:03.597+09:00">Even at the age of sixty,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-4a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:03.597+09:00">he did not even glance at the vegetables in his garden.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-4a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:03.597+09:00">See "Yù Lǎn" 976.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-4a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:03.597+09:00">I, in writing "Xīn Lùn,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-4a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:03.597+09:00">distinguished between ancient and modern times</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-4a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:03.597+09:00">and also desired to promote good governance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-4a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:03.597+09:00">How is this different from the "Chūnqiū's" praise and censure?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-4a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:03.597+09:00">Now, there are doubters,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-4a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:03.597+09:00">who say such things as "a *bàng* is different from a *gé*,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-4a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:03.597+09:00">"two and five do not make ten."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-4a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:03.597+09:00">Tán, having seen Liú Xiàng's "Xīn Xù,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-4a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:03.597+09:00">and Lù Jiǎ's "Xīn Yǔ,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-4a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:44.695+09:00">Thereupon, he wrote the *Xīn Lùn* (New Treatise).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-4a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:44.695+09:00">Zhuāng Zhōu's fables,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-4a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:44.695+09:00">state:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-4a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:44.695+09:00">"Yáo asked Kǒngzǐ."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-4a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:44.695+09:00">The *Huáinánzǐ* states:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-4a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:44.695+09:00">"Gònggōng contended for the emperorship,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-4a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:44.695+09:00">and the cords of the earth were severed."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-4a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:44.695+09:00">These are all fabricated.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-4a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:44.695+09:00">Therefore, people often say:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-4a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:44.695+09:00">"Short books are unusable."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-4a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:44.695+09:00">However, regarding matters of the heavens, no one is more knowledgeable than the sages.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-4a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:44.695+09:00">Although Zhuāng Zhōu and others are fantastical,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-4a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:44.695+09:00">we should still adopt their good points.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-4a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:44.695+09:00">Why say we should discard everything?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-4a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:44.695+09:00">See *Yùlǎn* 602.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-4a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:44.695+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:44.695+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:44.695+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.4-h" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:44.695+09:00">*Chapter Two: Kings and Hegemons*</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:44.695+09:00">The emperors,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:44.695+09:00">followed by the Three Kings and Five Hegemons,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:44.695+09:00">are the foremost leaders of the world.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:44.695+09:00">Thus, it is said that the Three Sovereigns governed with the Dào (Way),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:44.695+09:00">while the Five Emperors transformed through virtue.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:44.695+09:00">The Three Kings relied on benevolence and righteousness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:44.695+09:00">and the Five Hegemons employed expediency and wisdom.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:44.695+09:00">It explains them as follows:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:25:44.695+09:00">Without regulations or</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:26:35.113+09:00">To use penal law is called *Huáng* (Emperor);</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:26:35.113+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:26:35.113+09:00">to have regulations and laws</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:26:35.113+09:00">but no penal law is called *Dì* (Sovereign);</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:26:35.113+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:26:35.113+09:00">to reward the good and punish the evil,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:26:35.113+09:00">with the feudal lords attending the court,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:26:35.113+09:00">is called *Wáng* (King);</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:26:35.113+09:00">to raise troops and mobilize the masses,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:26:35.113+09:00">to make alliances and oaths,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:26:35.113+09:00">and to rectify the world with trustworthiness and righteousness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:26:35.113+09:00">is called *Bà* (Hegemon).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:26:35.113+09:00">*Wáng* (King) means "going,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:26:35.113+09:00">speaking of how his benevolent grace is leisurely and abundant,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:26:35.113+09:00">and the world turns to him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:26:35.113+09:00">The time before the Five Emperors is too distant,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:26:35.113+09:00">and there are no matters recorded in the classics.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:26:35.113+09:00">Only the meanings of the flourishing of *Wáng* (King) and *Bà* (Hegemon)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:26:35.113+09:00">can be used to determine the principles of ancient and modern times.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:26:35.113+09:00">Now, the governance of the *wáng* (kingly) way</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:26:35.113+09:00">first removes harms to the people,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:26:35.113+09:00">and ensures they have sufficient clothing and food;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:26:35.113+09:00">then teaches them rituals and propriety,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:26:35.113+09:00">causing them to know what to like and dislike, what to approach and avoid.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:26:35.113+09:00">Therefore, great transformation gathers from all directions,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:26:35.113+09:00">and the world is peaceful and happy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:26:35.113+09:00">This is the art of the *Wáng* (King).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:26:35.113+09:00">The greatest achievement of the *Bà* (Hegemon)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:29:26.875+09:00">Respect the ruler, humble the ministers,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:29:26.875+09:00">authority is unified,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:29:26.875+09:00">government does not proceed from two doors,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:29:26.875+09:00">rewards and punishments must be trustworthy,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:29:26.875+09:00">laws and decrees are clearly proclaimed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:29:26.875+09:00">the officials are well-ordered,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:29:26.875+09:00">authority must be carried out.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:29:26.875+09:00">This is the art of the hegemon.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:29:26.875+09:00">The king is pure,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:29:26.875+09:00">his virtue is like that;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.51" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:29:26.875+09:00">the way of the hegemon is mixed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.52" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:29:26.875+09:00">his achievement is like this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.53" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:29:26.875+09:00">Both possess the world,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.54" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:29:26.875+09:00">and rule the myriad people,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-7a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:29:26.875+09:00">the outcome can also be hegemony."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.55" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:29:26.875+09:00">bequeathing the succession to their descendants,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-7a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:29:26.875+09:00">This saying is not right!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.56" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:29:26.875+09:00">in reality, they are the same.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-7a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:29:26.875+09:00">The *Zhuan* says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-5a.57" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:29:26.875+09:00">See *Yì Lín*, *Shǐjì‧Qín Běnjì Zhèngyì*, *Chángduǎn Jīng‧Tōngbiàn*, *Yù Lǎn* 77 and 403.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-6a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:29:26.875+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-7a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:29:26.875+09:00">"The disciples of Kǒngzǐ,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-6a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:29:26.875+09:00">Tāng and Wǔ then long occupied the position of the regional lords and hegemons,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-7a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:29:26.875+09:00">even a five-foot child,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-6a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:29:26.875+09:00">with their virtue and grace benefiting the common people.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-7a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:29:26.875+09:00">do not speak of the affairs of the Five Hegemons,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-6a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:29:26.875+09:00">See note in *Wénxuǎn‧Diǎn Yǐn*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-7a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:31:57.486+09:00">because they hate that they violated benevolence and righteousness</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-6a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:29:26.875+09:00">The master of the Kingly Way,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-7a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:31:57.486+09:00">and valued power and deceit."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-6a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:29:26.875+09:00">his virtue can carry [everything],</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-7a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:31:57.486+09:00">See *Yilin*, *Yu Lan* 77.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-6a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:29:26.875+09:00">encompassing all to govern the universe.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-8a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:31:57.486+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-8a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:31:57.486+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-6a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:29:26.875+09:00">See *Chūxué Jì* 9.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-7a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:29:26.875+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-8a.4-h" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:31:57.486+09:00">*Seeking Assistance, Third*</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-8a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:31:57.486+09:00">Those who govern a state,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-7a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:29:26.875+09:00">A Confucian scholar might say:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-8a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:31:57.486+09:00">the foundation of assistance,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-7a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:29:26.875+09:00">"If planning for kingship fails,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-8a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:31:57.486+09:00">is that their appointments should all gain great talent.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-8a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:31:57.486+09:00">Great talent is like the limbs and wings of the ruler.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-8a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:31:57.486+09:00">See *Yilin*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-8a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:31:57.486+09:00">Dukes and great men, then, gladly obtain good teachers and wise assistants,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-8a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:31:57.486+09:00">common people then, gladly nurture benevolent, virtuous, and wise scholars,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-8a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:31:57.486+09:00">all are pillars of the state and wings of the people.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-8a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:31:57.486+09:00">See *Yu Lan* 187.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-9a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:31:57.486+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-9a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:31:57.486+09:00">A true king is easy to assist,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-9a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:31:57.486+09:00">a hegemon is difficult to aid.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-9a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:31:57.486+09:00">See *Yilin‧Appointment of Sons*, quoting Huán Tán's words.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-9a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:31:57.486+09:00">In the past, Ī Yǐn of the Yin dynasty,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-9a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:31:57.486+09:00">Tàigōng of the Zhōu dynasty,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-9a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:31:57.486+09:00">Bǎilǐ Xī of the Qín dynasty,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-9a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:33:44.094+09:00">雖咸有大才，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-9a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:33:44.094+09:00">they were all over seventy years old,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-9a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:33:44.094+09:00">yet they were promoted to be Wangbà (kingly and hegemonic) teachers.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-9a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:33:44.094+09:00">See *Yùlǎn* 404.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-10a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:33:44.094+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-10a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:33:44.094+09:00">Formerly, the King of Qín saw that the Zhōu dynasty had lost control, and lost power to the feudal lords,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-10a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:33:44.094+09:00">失統，喪權于諸侯，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-10a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:33:44.094+09:00">and considered himself fit to possess the nine provinces.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-10a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:33:44.094+09:00">Seeing the myriad people as mediocre,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-10a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:33:44.094+09:00">like a flock of sheep gathered like pigs,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-10a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:33:44.094+09:00">all of whom could be driven with a pole,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-10a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:33:44.094+09:00">therefore he relied on himself,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-10a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:33:44.094+09:00">and did not trust others</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-10a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:33:44.094+09:00">to enfeoff and establish feudal lords.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-10a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:33:44.094+09:00">And when Chén Shèng, Chǔ, and Hàn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-10a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:33:44.094+09:00">all arose from commoners,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-10a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:33:44.094+09:00">and were not enfeoffed lords with land,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-10a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:33:44.094+09:00">but together destroyed Qín,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-10a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:33:44.094+09:00">it was ultimately because of this failure.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-10a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:33:44.094+09:00">Emperor Gāo, having settled the empire,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-10a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:33:44.094+09:00">remembering that Xiàng Wáng entered through Hángǔ Pass,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-10a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:33:44.094+09:00">while he himself arrived through Wǔ Pass,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-10a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:33:44.094+09:00">pushed back the passes,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-10a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:33:44.094+09:00">repaired and strengthened the defenses,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-10a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:33:44.094+09:00">internally filled and strengthened the three armies,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-10a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:33:44.094+09:00">externally dispatched many troops for garrison duty,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-10a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:33:44.094+09:00">established laws to thoroughly investigate partisan factions,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0192_tls_001-10a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-30T04:33:44.094+09:00">and heavily rewarded those who reported rebellion.</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
</TEI>